:: Fae Realm
<<effects>><<location "fae_forest">>
You are in a strange mystical place. Towering luminous purple mushrooms light up the forest in the night. There's no telling what kind of dangers might be here.
<br><br>
<<set $danger to random(1, 10000)>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<passoutfae>>
<<elseif $eventskip is 0>>
	<<if $danger gte (9900 - $allure) and ($settings.bestialityEnabled or $monster is 1)>>
		<<eventfae>>
	<<else>>
		<<eventfaesafe>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<if $faenorth is 3 and $faeeast is -2 and $haegishintro is undefined>>
		You come upon an open grove in the forest. Within the grove is a large... table? Someone seems to be sitting there.
		<br>
		<<link [[Enter the grove|Haegish Intro]]>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<<elseif $faenorth is 3 and $faeeast is -2>>
		You come upon an open grove in the forest. Within the grove is a large table where you see Haegish.
		<br>
		<<link [[Enter the grove|Haegish Grove]]>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $faenorth is -2 and $faeeast is -3>>
		As you make your way through the brush, you come to a large ruined fort. Glowing orange vines grow down the cracked stone walls.
		<br>
		<<link [[Enter the fort|Fae Fort]]>><</link>>
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $faenorth is -2 and $faeeast is 2>>
		You are at a small cliff face, you could walk around it fairly easily.
		<br><br>
		<<if $faeidol isnot undefined>>
			This must be where that voice told you to go, you feel a tightness in your chest as you approach the cliff face.
			<br>
			<<link [[Press your hand to the cliff face|Fae Cliff]]>><</link>>
			<br><br>
		<<elseif $vesselform is 1>>
			You can see the small hidden passage in the cliff leading to Auspacia's shrine.
			<br>
			<<link [[Enter the passage|Auspacia Shrine Back]]>><</link>>
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $faenorth lt 5>>
		<<link [[Make your way north|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip -= 1>><<set $faenorth += 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $faenorth gt -5>>
		<<link [[Make your way south|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip -= 1>><<set $faenorth -= 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $faeeast lt 5>>
		<<link [[Make your way east|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip -= 1>><<set $faeeast += 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $faeeast gt -5>>
		<<link [[Make your way west|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip -= 1>><<set $faeeast -= 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

:: Fae Fort
<<set $location to "fae_fort">>
<<set $lock to 1000>>
You enter the large decaying stone fort. Cracks cover the wall and it creaks ominously. This fort probably won't hold up too much longer. A locked stone door blocks a door leading deep into the ground. You wonder what could be down there. Additionally there seems to be a door leading back into a back room of the fort that seems quite fancy.
<br><br>
<<if $faefortlock is 1>>
	<span class="green">The locks already open.</span>
	<br>
	<<link [[Pick lock|Fae Fort Basement]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $skulduggery gte $lock>>
	<span class="green">The locks look easy to pick.</span>
	<br>
	<<link [[Pick lock|Fae Fort Pick Lock]]>><</link>>
	<br><br>
<<else>>
	<span class="blue">The locks look beyond your ability to pick.</span> <<skulduggeryrequired>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<if $ghost gte 1>>
	You can phase through the door if you concentrate. 
	<br>
	<<link [[Phase (0:01)|Fae Fort Basement]]>><<tiredness 20>><<pass 1>><</link>><<ggtiredness>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Go to the back room|Fae Fort Back]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Fae Realm]]>><</link>>

:: Fae Fort Back
You are in the back room of the fort. The damage seems much less here but there is still holes in the ceiling and crumbled brick across the floor. Various trashy knicknacks sit in boxes around the room. You might be able to find something if you look hard enough.
<br><br>
<<link [[Search the boxes|Fae Fort Search]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Go back to the front of the fort|Fae Fort]]>><</link>>

:: Fae Fort Search
<<rng>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax and !$possessed>>
	<<passoutfae>>
<<elseif $rng gte 81 and $haegishquest is 1>>
	You reach inside one of the boxes. You find a jar of leaves. The label seems to be some kind of obscure tea brand? You pocket it for Haegish.<<set $haegishquest to 2>>
<<elseif $rng gte 81>>
	You reach inside one of the boxes. It's full of small coins. You could probably fetch some money for these.<<money 50000>>
<<elseif $rng gte 61>>
	You reach inside one of the boxes. Something inside snaps at you. You pull your hand away in time, but it was close.
	<<gstress>><<stress 3>>
<<elseif $rng gte 41>>
	You reach inside one of the boxes. It's full of mud.
<<elseif $rng gte 21>>
	<<wearProp "rock">>
	You reach inside one of the boxes. It's full of pebbles.
<<else>>
	You reach inside one of the boxes. It's empty.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Search the boxes|Fae Fort Search]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Go back to the front of the fort|Fae Fort]]>><</link>>

:: Fae Fort Pick Lock
<<effects>><<skulduggeryskilluse>>
<<set $faefortlock to 1>>
You take some time fiddling with the lock before popping it open and opening the door.
<br><br>
<<link [[Go into the basement|Fae Fort Basement]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Go back|Fae Fort]]>><</link>>

:: Fae Fort Basement
The fort's basement is large but fairly empty. A pedistal stands at the center of the room. <<if $faeidol is undefined>>A luminous golden idol of a strange creature illuminates the room.<<else>>The pedistal is now empty.<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $faeidol is undefined>>
	<<link [[Take the glowing idol|Fae Idol]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Go back|Fae Fort]]>><</link>>

:: Fae Idol
As you touch the idol you suddenly feel a splitting headache. You collapse to the floor curling in pain like nothing you've ever felt before. Your body straing and bends in unnatural ways before the pain subsides and a voice speaks to you. <span class = "toxicgreen">"How dare a mortal defile my shrine."</span> The voice echoes around the room yet comes from seemingly nowhere. <span class = "toxicgreen">"You mortal, find my shrine to the east. I have need of your presence. If you obey like a good subject, I may just reward you."</span>
<br><br>
You breath heavily as the presence leaves, ripping the fabric of your mind. It seems you were able to take the idol but... do you dare search any further?
<br>
<<link [[Next|Fae Fort Basement]]>><<set $faeidol to 1>><<set $antiquemoney += 15000>><<museumAntiqueStatus "faeidol" "found">><</link>>

:: Fae Cliff
As you approach the cliff, your migrane intensifies. You stagger against the wall and hold your hand to your head. As you lean you feel something strange behind you. There's some sort of... lever, hidden in the rock face. You grab the stone carved handle hidden in the brush and pull. The stone begins to slide and opens a small stairway behind the cliff.
<br><br>
<<link [[Enter the passage|Auspacia Shrine]]>><<set $faeidol to 2>><</link>>

:: Auspacia Shrine
You follow the passage down into the cliff and find yourself entering a large room filled with lit candles. A statue sits at the center but... something is wrong. The color and shape continously morph into different forms. It shifts, from a large woman with six arms, to a large shapeless form wearing a skull and antlers, to a wild beast, and even still to a normal human. The inscription reads, "Auspacia, Goddess of Nature and the Wilds".
<br><br>
As you approach the strange fluctuating statue, your mind splits once more as a voice invades your mind. <span class = "toxicgreen">"You, mortal. You have listened and have listened well. It has been long since I have spoken to one of your ilk. What do you desire?"</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Power|Auspacia Shrine Wish]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Riches|Auspacia Shrine Wish]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Wisdom|Auspacia Shrine Wish]]>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Love|Auspacia Shrine Wish]]>><<set $phase to 4>><</link>>

:: Auspacia Shrine Wish
The voice listens as you speak your desire.
<br><br>
<<if $phase is 1>>
<span class = "toxicgreen">"You wish for power? What an asinine desire. Truly a fool who would rely on strength to live."</span>
<<elseif $phase is 2>>
<span class = "toxicgreen">"You wish for riches? How foolish. Riches would never fulfill your true needs."</span>
<<elseif $phase is 3>>
<span class = "toxicgreen">"You wish for wisdom? I can tell you need it with how ridiculous your desires are."</span>
<<else>>
<span class = "toxicgreen">"You wish for love? True love can't come purely from desire, you need to work on it yourself."</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<span class = "toxicgreen">"I have heard your desires and you have left me quite disappointed mortal. Is there nothing more to you than wanton desire?"</span> The voice pauses as if to scoff at your foolishness. <span class = "toxicgreen">"I can give you what you truly need, under one condition.</span> <span class = "red">Free me.</span> <span class = "toxicgreen">Destroy the vessel and free my true unrestrained self."</span>
<br><br>
<span class = "red">This action may have consequences. Think twice before accepting.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Break the statue|Auspacia Shrine Free]]>><<set $vesselform to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave for now|Fae Realm]]>><<set $vesselform to 1>><</link>>

:: Auspacia Shrine Back
You follow the passage down into the cliff and find yourself entering a large room filled with lit candles. A statue sits at the center but... something is wrong. The color and shape continously morph into different forms. It shifts, from a large woman with six arms, to a large shapeless form wearing a skull and antlers, to a wild beast, and even still to a normal human. The inscription reads, "Auspacia, Goddess of Nature and the Wilds".
<br><br>
As you approach the strange fluctuating statue, your mind splits once more as a voice invades your mind. <span class = "toxicgreen">"You, mortal. You return. Are you finally ready to</span> <span class = "red">free me?</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Break the statue|Auspacia Shrine Free]]>><<set $vesselform to 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave for now|Fae Realm]]>><</link>>

:: Auspacia Shrine Free
You press against the shifting statue and it creaks. It seems not very well balanced, a good push should do it. You ready your shoulder and push against the statue as hard as you can.
<br><br>
<span class = "red">The statue tilts and smashes against the floor into pieces.</span>
<br><br>
<span class = "toxicgreen">"Yes yes! Finally!"</span> The voice speaks through your mind as a dark shadow coalesces. The shadows warp and twist before fusing back into a solid form. Standing more than five meters tall, there is a six armed woman, her face obscured by a huge mammoth skull. Her piercing green eyes glow ominously in the candle light. She looks toward you and reaches one of her huge arms down, holding your head with a single massive finger.
<br><br>
As she speaks, her voice rumbles with force shaking the cave walls. <span class = "toxicgreen">"You have done well mortal. You have earned my boon."</span>
<br><br>
The ground shakes but not just in the cave, you can feel the entire Earth beneath your feet quake and animals outside panic. The cave begins to collapse and suddenly everything goes black.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Fae Destroyed]]>><<set $stress -= 5000>><<pass 360>><<set $faetf to 1>><<set $permanentTransform to 1>><<set V.transformationParts.eldritch.mist to "disabled">><<set V.transformationParts.fae.wings to "default">><<set V.transformationParts.fae.fairies to "default">><<set V.transformationParts.goblin.ears to "default">><</link>>

:: Fae Destroyed
<<location "forest">>
You wake up inside the tree hollow last night... Just what happened? Your body feels strange and as you examine yourself, you find a mystical presence you have never felt before. Strange new wings adorn your back and small fae seem attracted to your presence.
<br><br>
The surroundings have... changed slightly. The mushroom circles around you have been charred and the hollows burnt as well. <span class = "red">You feel you will likely never see that fantastical place again.</span>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Forest]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>